  "source_assessment": {
    "actual_source_execution": "Bootstrap path is exact actualW54 ROOT sibling, canonical nonsymlink regular file; read capped65537 and whole9974pin before compile. Bootstrap admits actual raw D/G/C/H wholebody pins, permits only single reviewed G/C seal normalization for comparison, then executes original rawactual source. Fixture.setUpClass/TestCase methods are defined but not called. No archive/captured/normalized code execution found.",
    "compact_return": "Actual C.compact returns bytearray; stream.write accepts that buffer, so no bytes-type defect. Its stream checks every token and len(result)+len(piece)<=8MiB before extension. D.derive enforces its combined unsigned input/encoded-proposal logical64MiB bound. Entry adds no helper or capraise; no heap/RSS/capacity claim follows.",
    "derive_current_inputs": "Actual W54 fixed sibling fixture lane/amendment bytes are read with65536ceilings and match D fixed hashes; actual W54 tools/build_plan.py read with262144 ceiling supplies proposed current generator authority. These fixture origins must later be installed/compared exactly to actual D.FRAGMENT/D.AMENDMENT; reading fixtures is not execution of new generator or proof those normative files are installed.",
    "derive_origin": "H.originals(PRIOR) explicitly reads originalW53.11 root DATA. Actual H requires exact oldlock, finite66 canonical roles, stat/body/aggregate checks and wholebaseline/register/tails validation. Entry drops exactlyTAILS to64, then actual D.derive revalidates old64 and complete797 obligations. No globals patch, fake C.prior/seal, changedW54 .11 capture claim or archiveprogram execution.",
    "derive_output_admission": "After bounded encode and beforemkdir: absolute output; canonical existing parent; target absent/nonsymlink; lexically inside qualified fixed C.OUTPUT_ROOT /workspace/build/builderbob; parent UID matches operator. mkdir0700 plus proposal.json xb provides fresh no-overwrite emission. Invalid parent/missing path/mkdir/open/write failure cannot report successful output. No system mount/headroom check is performed by this source; fresh root admission remains required.",
    "early_fail_closed": "BASE_MAIN remains PENDING and its40-lowercasehex guard executes before BOOTSTRAP opening, compiling or actual subject modules. A syntactically valid hash does not establish qualified parent truth: root must substitute only actual future F-main readback and freeze that exact new entry.",
    "historical_phase": "C actual helper maintains old64/66 separateceilings, raw50/gzip16 catalogue partition, prior55/342/797 checks, current72 roles, max1300 physicalsnapshot andN<=62 composition. Entry does not by itself establish exact final proof count, actual combined fit or completeness; runtime/data review must.",
    "norm_snapshot_default": "norm invokes genuine actual default C.contract_lock(); snapshot invokes actual C.snapshot(fixed fresh snapshot ID, eventual BASE_MAIN). Both call closure-owned registered-proposal C.emit_fresh: pending seal refusal, immutable pins/reserve/bindings/seal authority, exact encoded container/body/aggregate bounds, outputbytes hash check, physicalsource recheck, fresh canonical owned Samsung output and xb. No oracle or staged reader substitute.",
    "unsigned_output": "D.derive returns UNSEALED_PROPOSAL_ONLY including expected-plan as an oracle inside proposal.json. Entry writes only new proposal.json and does not install plan/contract/schema/locks/briefs/dispatch. Actual real generator N/O output remains required and must be compared independently."
